Covered
-------

- content/demo.json (texts and context definitions)
- schema/demo.schema.json (descriptions)
- docs/
- public/audio/ (the three demo voices, see below)
- The procedural scenes as rendered or exported (export/*.glb, export/demo.jsonld)

All source code is licensed separately under the Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE).

Everything visual is made in code: procedural geometry, shaders and canvas textures. The repository contains
no third-party images, photographs, plans, engravings, coin images or downloaded models, and no
AI-generated images. All texts are placeholders pending heritage expert validation.

Synthetic voices
----------------

public/audio/context-a.m4a, context-b.m4a and context-c.m4a are synthetic placeholder voices, generated with a
text-to-speech model and labelled "Synthetic placeholder voice" wherever they play.

Model: Kokoro-82M
Voice: af_nicole (Nicole)
Licence: Apache-2.0

The voices' use here must also follow the model's licence. They will be replaced by recorded voices of real
people, with their consent.

